  "title": "The Best Beef Tri-Tip",
  "description": "This tri-tip recipe from Chef John uses his foolproof method of cooking a spice-rubbed beef tri-tip roast low and slow until tender and flavorful.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
